  "instructions": [
    "Heat butter in a large pan over medium heat.",
    "Add chopped red onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add arborio rice and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add red pepper flakes, ground allspice, salt, and black pepper. Stir to combine.",
    "Add halibut fillets and cook for 2-3 minutes, until browned on both sides.",
    "Add water and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer for 10-12 minutes, until rice is cooked and liquid is absorbed.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and tobiko.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional tobiko if desired."
